<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 500 mln mark step-down bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 500 mln mark step-down bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hypobank Munich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.30	MATURITY   *27.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-DOWN     ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE  S-20.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 27.NOV.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-DOWN</p>
<p>TO</p>
<p>		 4.20 PCT</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
